  "claim_boundary": [
    "This contract covers the frozen same-observed-precursor identity-candidate axis only; it is not a chemical-relation score contract.",
    "Every one of the 291330 directed candidate pairs and every one of the 139129 nonempty blocks must be delivered; 628925 zero-candidate blocks remain structural abstentions in the frozen axis.",
    "A raw model ranking score is preserved without clipping and is not interpreted as a probability.",
    "Missing final-method evidence causes block abstention; WSE or any other method cannot fill a missing score.",
    "A model forms its own block decisions on the complete frozen candidate blocks; WSE-selected edges do not define another model's candidate set.",
